        "message": "Privacy Badger 會自動學習封鎖隱藏的追蹤器。花一分鐘來看背後的原理。",
        "description": ""
    },
    "intro_beyond_ads": {
        "message": "捕捉鬼鬼祟祟的追蹤器",
        "description": ""
    },
    "intro_beyond_ads_paragraph": {
        "message": "Privacy Badger 傳送<a href='https://globalprivacycontrol.org/' target='_blank'>「全域隱私控制」信號</a>，來讓您退出資料分享與販賣，以及 <a href='https://www.eff.org/issues/do-not-track' target='_blank'>「請勿追蹤」信號</a>來告訴公司不要追蹤您。",
        "description": ""
    },
    "intro_beyond_ads_paragraph2": {
        "message": "如果它們忽略這些訊號，Privacy Badger 會學習封鎖它們，不論是廣告商還是其他類型的追蹤器。",
        "description": ""
    },
    "intro_not_an_adblocker": {
        "message": "不是廣告攔截器",
        "description": ""
    },
    "intro_learns_paragraph": {
        "message": "Privacy Badger 會根據行為自動探索追蹤器。",
        "description": ""
    },
    "intro_not_an_adblocker_paragraph2": {
        "message": "隱藏的追蹤會以各種方式發生；廣告只是冰山一角。Privacy Badger 不會封鎖廣告，除非它們正好在追蹤您。",
        "description": ""
    },
